## Microsoft Graph API Permissions

The following client `application` permissions are needed in order to use this {{.Type | lower}}:

**Required:**
- `Synchronization.ReadWrite.All`

**Optional:**
- `Synchronization.Read.All` (plan and refresh only)
- `Application.ReadWrite.OwnedBy` or `Application.ReadWrite.All` (higher-privileged alternatives)

